{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You were a programmer working on the online game <i>Magic World</i>, but after its launch, your boss heartlessly fired you. To support your family, you decide to create automated scripts for <i>Magic World\u00a0</i>to farm dungeons, loot equipment, and sell it for cash. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create automated scripts</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Looks complex, plays simple!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635870/extras/ffb141cbb8de0e7c8250189827a5bf46.avif?t=1773660858\" width=616 height=346 /></span></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Farm dungeons</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let bots do the grinding\u2014sit back and enjoy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635870/extras/a3946f1452c07780932497ebd95c269d.avif?t=1773660858\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Loot equipment</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Check out my epic haul\u2014Legendary Shield acquired!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635870/extras/60d1db3ef1747cf39ad55612611f1b40.avif?t=1773660858\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Sell it for cash</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rarity dictates value\u2014the rarer, the pricier!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3635870/extras/eda3438ec1ccf67dfb6d166ae5b07a4e.avif?t=1773660858\" width=616 height=346 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Build Your Home</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Furnish your space and create a cozy home for your family!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn